      "role": "user",
      "content": "i finally did it. i got the promotion and the corner office and everything i spent the last ten years working for. i’m sitting here looking at the view and i just feel... nothing. it's like i climbed the whole mountain just to realize there's nothing at the top. it feels pointless.",
